# Silicon Labs Project Configuration Tools: slcp, v0, Component selection file.
project_name: smartwings_bootloader
label: smartwings_bootloader
description: |
  Demonstrates how to configure the Gecko Bootloader to store firmware update images using internal main flash, in a single-slot setup with a 352 kB slot starting at 0x5C000.
category: Example|Bootloader
filter:
- name: Device Type
  value:
  - SoC
- name: MCU
  value:
  - Bootloader
- name: Project Difficulty
  value:
  - Advanced
package: bootloader
quality: production
readme:
